{"glossary":[
{"term_id":"revenue","canonical_term":"revenue","display_name":"營收","definition":"在收入邏輯資料集以月份及分析維度彙總的營收金額。","aliases":["營收","revenue amount","revenue_amount"],"related_metrics":["revenue_amount"],"related_dimensions":[],"ambiguity_notes":"不含毛利或出貨量。"},
